ix is not common and is discouraged in a Password Input component. In very specific cases, it can provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context or format requirements (e.g., “DEV-” for test accounts, “admin-” as a pattern to define an admin password)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"lock icon"}]},{"type":"text","text":": it helps to reinforce the security context."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text"}]},{"type":"text","text":":  A supporting text conveys additional information about the password field."}]}]}]},{"text":"Outlined style","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Outlined-style"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   OUDSPasswordInput(label: \"Your password\", password: $password, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable from a bundle","   OUDSPasswordInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"password_label\"), bundle: Bundle.module, password: $password)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Rounded layout","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Rounded-layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As the","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":" OUDSTextInput"},{"text":", rounded corners can be enabled or disabled using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasRoundedTextInputs"},{"text":" values of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"text":" object","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in your theme configuration.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Status","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Status"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineConte